### US-007: Forward terminal notifications from desktop to mobile
Status: in_progress
Depends on: US-004

Description:
As a mobile user, I want terminal notifications received by the desktop agent to appear on mobile.

Acceptance Criteria:
- [ ] Define a terminal notification payload and delivery path from desktop agent to mobile
- [ ] Mobile stores notifications in timeline and optionally surfaces a toast/banner
- [ ] Example: terminal session emits a warning notification and mobile shows it in the timeline
- [ ] Negative case: if mobile is offline, notifications queue or fail gracefully without crashing


If the story details are empty or missing, STOP and report that the PRD story format could not be parsed.

